## 7. ⚠️ MEDIUM: Information Disclosure in Error Handling (OWASP A04:2021 - Insecure Design)

**Issue:** Default Express error handler may leak stack traces.

**Risk:** Attackers gain insights into application structure and dependencies.

**Fix:**
```javascript
// Custom error handler - MUST be last
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  logger.error(err.message, { stack: err.stack }); // Log full error server-side

  // Don't leak error details to client
  const statusCode = err.statusCode || 500;
  const message = process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' 
    ? 'Internal Server Error' 
    : err.message;

  res.status(statusCode).json({
    error: {
      message,
      ...(process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production' && { stack: err.stack })
    }
  });
});
```

